{
  "uid": "codex-usage",
  "title": "Codex Usage",
  "description": "Codex (OpenAI) CLI/desktop telemetry — turns, tokens, latency, tools, and events. No cost panels (ChatGPT-subscription auth emits no cost telemetry). Sparse-event/occurrence panels use Loki count_over_time, not expired-counter increase(). OTL fix 2026-08-24: the Turns/Tool Calls/Threads/Codex-Events/Codex-Errors Loki panels were matching the log BODY, which is always empty for structured codex.* events (all data rides as structured metadata) — fixed to metadata pipeline filters (`| event_name=\"...\"`, `| success=\"false\"`). TTFT/Turn-Latency/TTFM panels pointed at metric names that no longer exist (`*_seconds_bucket` was renamed to `*_duration_ms_milliseconds_bucket` upstream) — fixed + unit corrected to ms. IMPORTANT: codex_exec (headless relay workers) emits NO codex_conversation_turn_count_total / codex_turn_token_usage_* / codex_turn_e2e_duration_ms_* — Tokens, Cache Hit Rate, Turn Rate by Model, Tokens by Model, and Turn Latency reflect Codex Desktop/app-server ONLY. Headless relay turns/tokens/tool-calls by ticket live in the Codex — Relay Attribution row below (Loki + the few codex_exec-native Prometheus metrics: codex_tool_call_total, codex_thread_started_total, codex_turn_ttft/ttfm_duration_ms).",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "style": "dark",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "liveNow": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "tags": ["codex", "observability"],
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "bucket",
        "type": "interval",
        "label": "Interval",
        "query": "1m,5m,15m,30m,1h,6h,1d",
        "current": { "text": "5m", "value": "5m" },
        "auto": false,
        "auto_count": 30,
        "auto_min": "10s",
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 2,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Model",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(codex_conversation_turn_count_total, model)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "originator",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Originator",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(codex_tool_call_total, originator)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "hostname",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Host",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(codex_conversation_turn_count_total, host_name)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "linear_key",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Ticket",
        "description": "CTC-* relay ticket. Sourced from codex_tool_call_total, the one native codex_exec (headless) Prometheus metric confirmed to carry linear_key/project/task_type/branch/host_name (2026-08-24) -- codex_conversation_turn_count_total and codex_turn_token_usage_* carry NO ticket dims for headless (Desktop-only).",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(codex_tool_call_total, linear_key)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "project",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Project",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(codex_tool_call_total, project)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Codex — Overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Turns",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"codex.*\"} | event_name=\"codex.turn_ttft\" | originator=~\"$originator\" [$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "Turns",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "#73BF69", "value": null } ] },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background_solid",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false, "fields": "" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tokens",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 1 },
