      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TTFT / TTFM Latency (p50/p95)",
      "description": "codex_turn_ttft_duration_ms / codex_turn_ttfm_duration_ms — verified 2026-08-24 to be emitted by BOTH codex_exec (headless relay) and Codex_Desktop, unlike Turn Latency (e2e) which is Desktop-only.",
