      "id": 54,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Relay Token Usage by Ticket (headless, input/output)",
      "description": "codex_exec emits NO codex_turn_token_usage_* metric -- the only token-usage signal for headless relay work is Loki structured metadata on codex.sse_event (input_token_count/output_token_count/cached_token_count/reasoning_token_count/tool_token_count), verified 2026-08-24. unwrap sums those fields per ticket.",
